{"unit_id":"happyqu__dsh-plugin-git#card-zh","repo":"happyqu/dsh-plugin-git","commit":"fc2aa659b2a26fe192171f1bca62a690e94c4fc0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-git 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Git 工作台，在会话标题栏和工作区入口打开独立窗口，并通过 Host RPC 操作当前会话对应的仓库。它提供改动查看、逐块暂存、提交与分支同步、提交图和历史整理、冲突解决、储藏及工作树管理；也可调用 DSH 当前模型生成提交信息和解释提交。适合希望在 DSH 内完成日常 Git 操作的开发者。需要本机可用的 Git；AI 功能使用 DSH 已配置的模型，GitHub 仓库管理功能使用已有 GitHub 凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:43-96","lib/index.js:197-249","lib/git/hunks.js:311-402","lib/ai.js:177-216"]}
{"unit_id":"happyqu__dsh-plugin-git#card-en","repo":"happyqu/dsh-plugin-git","commit":"fc2aa659b2a26fe192171f1bca62a690e94c4fc0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-git adds a Git workbench to DSH for reviewing changes, staging hunks, committing, syncing branches, browsing history, resolving conflicts, and managing worktrees. Optional AI features draft commit messages and explain commits with the selected model. Git must be available on the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:43-96","lib/index.js:197-249","lib/git/hunks.js:311-402","lib/ai.js:177-216"]}
